                    "message": "@paligill@gmail.com - Are we wanting to update the meta-phosphor here?  I would have expected this to be an `:append` in meta-facebook only."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/flash/phosphor-software-manager_git.bb",
