                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Fred raised this patch after you asked him to add it to a common place (in another patch) to avoid redoing it for every platform, but might be the confusion was where in common place (just facebook common or common for all).\n\nTBH, I was preferring to add it only for meta-facebook and look like you also want same. So, @Fred.Chen@quantatw.com Can you please append this for meta-facebook only."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/flash/phosphor-software-manager_git.bb",
                    "line": 29,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Agreed.  Let's just change the meta-facebook one.\n\nSupporting i2cvr and cpld is currently only a meta-facebook machine feature.  If others start heavily relying on it maybe we can change the top level defaults."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/flash/phosphor-software-manager_git.bb",
                    "line": 29,
